{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26135","headline":"登长安慈恩寺塔 · 卢宗回","name":"登长安慈恩寺塔","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东方晓日上翔鸾，西转苍龙拂露盘。\n渭水寒光摇藻井，玉峰晴色上朱阑。\n九重宫阙参差见，百二山河表里观。\n蹔辍去蓬悲不定，一凭金界望长安。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢宗回","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26135.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26135","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}